{
  "metadata": {
    "name": "Motor-EPM \u00b7 homeokinetic (Rung 0/1) \u2699",
    "description": "MOTOR-EPM PHASE. Reward-free homeokinetic per-leg sensorimotor controller (forward self-model + controller learning by descending the motor Time-Loop Error, Der-Martius) REPLACES the 12 per-servo Premotors + cognitive premotor + Cruse. Run with NO curriculum (it is reward-free). docs/plans-and-designs/motor_epm_homeokinetic_plan.md. Generated by scripts/make_motor_epm_config.py.",
